## Risk Register

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Agent binaries differ across versions (flag names, prompt-passing) | Per-agent launcher isolates differences; failing launches fall back to `--track-only` |
| Stop-hook fires on agent crash and the TUI blocks indefinitely in a non-TTY context | Detect `term.IsTerminal(int(os.Stdin.Fd()))`; if false, log the pending-review state and skip the prompt — user can finalize manually next run |
| Concurrent `entire review` runs clobber each other's pending markers | Detect existing pending marker at start of `runReview`; prompt "cancel the in-progress review? [y/N]" |
| Session's agent name isn't recoverable after marker clear | Persisted into `state.ReviewSkills` at adoption time; add `ReviewAgent` field if needed later |
| Review commit lands on `main` by accident | Pre-flight warns (not blocks) when on `main`/`master`; user confirms |

